  "solution_ref": "$a_2=\\frac1{k+1}$, $a_3=\\frac1{k+1}-\\frac1k<0$, $a_4=\\frac{k-1}{k(k+1)}$, …. $k=1$: $a_4=0$, 주기 3 → $a_{22}=0$. $k=2$: $a_6=0$, 주기 5 → $a_{22}\\ne0$. $k=3$: $a_8=0$ → $a_{22}=0$. $k=4$: $a_{10}=0$ → $\\ne0$. $5\\le k\\le9$: $\\ne0$. $k=10$: $a_{22}=0$. $k\\ge11$: $\\ne0$. 합 $1+3+10=14$",
